{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Hero_Image_Small.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Welcome.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them... in this limited-but-still-fun <strong>Demo</strong> version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Demo_Content.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Full first 3 levels of construction tree (out of 5);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. One Jarl - The Builder (out of 5);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. One climate and one procedurally generated landscape type;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Construction, Exploration, Farming and Magic;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Limited to first 3 seasons (Spring, Summer and Autumn), around 45 minutes of gameplay;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Explore.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Explore.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a lonely bonfire and a lot of unexplored lands around you. Uncover the territory around to discover new places to build, supplies to gather, ruins to explore, runestones to study\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Builder_and_Interact.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Interact.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Living_World.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Living_World.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough has a unique landscape, environment and climate! As days and nights go by, so will the seasons, each bringing about changes to your town and the surroundings. Each season also comes with its own set of normal, and sometimes bizarre weather conditions. Prepare for the harsh winter, and use the conditions to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/No_Timer.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing to worry about. You cannot lose the game. Grab hot cocoa, wrap yourself in the blanket, relax, and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775310?t=1748947233","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775310?t=1748947233","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/2b36ceef47bc16f253f0e291184c5c91b45a4b5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748947233","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/2b36ceef47bc16f253f0e291184c5c91b45a4b5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748947233","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Hero_Image_Small.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Welcome.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them... in this limited-but-still-fun <strong>Demo</strong> version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Demo_Content.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Full first 3 levels of construction tree (out of 5);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. One Jarl - The Builder (out of 5);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. One climate and one procedurally generated landscape type;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Construction, Exploration, Farming and Magic;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Limited to first 3 seasons (Spring, Summer and Autumn), around 45 minutes of gameplay;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Explore.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Explore.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a lonely bonfire and a lot of unexplored lands around you. Uncover the territory around to discover new places to build, supplies to gather, ruins to explore, runestones to study\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Builder_and_Interact.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Interact.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Living_World.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/Living_World.gif?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough has a unique landscape, environment and climate! As days and nights go by, so will the seasons, each bringing about changes to your town and the surroundings. Each season also comes with its own set of normal, and sometimes bizarre weather conditions. Prepare for the harsh winter, and use the conditions to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/extras/No_Timer.png?t=1748947233\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing to worry about. You cannot lose the game. Grab hot cocoa, wrap yourself in the blanket, relax, and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hungry Trolls"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2345940","name":"Lost Lands"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775310/f88334fba98738d408bc624d386cda29777c749e/header.jpg?t=1748947233","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146703,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146703/movie480.mp4?t=1748535635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146703/movie_max.mp4?t=1748535635"},"name":"Steam Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146703/71f36a65753bfb321293866ed9175af58a75a821/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748535635","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146703/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748535635","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146703/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748535635"}}],"name":"Lost Lands Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-9300H<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3050<b